---
/**
 * The "fledg" letters. Newsreader's f has a long hooked top that, at the
 * wordmark's tight tracking, runs into the l. The display cut (opsz 72) has a
 * slimmer hook, and the extra space after the f keeps a clear gap at 1x.
 * Size, weight and tracking come from the parent.
 */
---
<span class="wordmark-letters"><span class="f">f</span>ledg</span>

<style>
  .wordmark-letters { font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72; }
  .f { letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
</style>
